WEBVTT

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:04.579
Cluster A has a saved record, but that record is not a live health check.

00:00:04.693 --> 00:00:09.379
Review the PE endpoint, expected UUID, complete node baseline

00:00:09.429 --> 00:00:10.829
and credential reference.

00:00:10.965 --> 00:00:13.354
Select Collect PE health deliberately.

00:00:13.582 --> 00:00:18.147
The operational-health collector requires trusted HTTPS and does not

00:00:18.147 --> 00:00:20.614
offer the specialist wizards' TLS exception.

00:00:20.835 --> 00:00:24.163
If collection fails, read the specific diagnostic.

00:00:24.307 --> 00:00:28.117
Untrusted issuer and certificate address mismatch have different fixes.

00:00:28.189 --> 00:00:32.832
An unresolved reference differs from HTTP four zero one authentication rejection

00:00:33.053 --> 00:00:35.339
or four zero three access denial.

00:00:35.508 --> 00:00:39.689
DNS, timeout, refused connection and routing errors describe

00:00:39.689 --> 00:00:43.421
transport failures. None of these alone proves an unhealthy cluster.

00:00:43.785 --> 00:00:46.796
A completed observation expires after fifteen minutes.

00:00:47.049 --> 00:00:51.479
Evidence age uses the appliance timestamps, while browser clock skew produces

00:00:51.487 --> 00:00:55.839
a separate warning. A workstation timezone display is not itself proof

00:00:55.839 --> 00:00:59.960
of clock drift. Correct invalid or future timestamps and time

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:02.284
synchronization before relying on the result.

00:01:02.733 --> 00:01:07.120
Use Live Prism Element drift to compare the supported settings against an approved

00:01:07.128 --> 00:01:10.879
baseline. Test the comparison manually before scheduling it.

00:01:11.037 --> 00:01:15.018
Keep a failed collection distinct from a real configuration difference.

00:01:15.261 --> 00:01:19.655
A schedule needs the same valid credentials, reachability and trust as

00:01:19.655 --> 00:01:23.157
the manual check. Refresh only reloads saved records;

00:01:23.165 --> 00:01:25.056
it does not collect Prism data.

00:01:25.256 --> 00:01:29.237
Review timestamps, source and the individual checks before acceptance.

00:01:29.394 --> 00:01:33.610
A PE Good readback is not a full NCC, resilience, application

00:01:33.789 --> 00:01:35.661
or recovery acceptance test.

00:01:35.843 --> 00:01:40.151
Close historical attention reviews deliberately after investigating their source.
